{{template "layout" .}}
{{- define "content" -}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">The API key <strong>{{.key}}</strong> in the project <strong>{{.project}}</strong> stops working on {{datetime .expires_at}}. SDKs that still use it can no longer send data after that.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">
<tr><td class="muted" style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;color:#556070;">Project</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{.project}}</td></tr>
<tr><td class="muted" style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;color:#556070;">Key</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{.key}} <span class="code" style="padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f2f5;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;">{{.prefix}}</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="muted" style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;color:#556070;">Expires</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{datetime .expires_at}}</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">To keep data flowing, rotate the key and deploy the new secret before then. If nothing uses the key any more, there is nothing to do.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;"><a class="button" href="{{link (print "/" (seg .slug) "/access")}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:6px;background:#5b4bff;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Review API keys</a></p>
<p class="muted" style="margin:0;color:#556070;">You get this email because you are an admin of {{.project}}. You can turn off these emails in your <a href="{{link "/settings"}}">account settings</a>.</p>
{{- end}}
